 "title": "The Night the Berlin Wall Fell, part 7: What Remains",
 "scenes": [
  {
   "narration": "Today, only fragments of the Wall still stand. The longest, the East Side Gallery, runs for about one point three kilometres along the River Spree, covered in murals.",
   "background": {
